/****************************************************************************
 * Name: stm32_stdclockconfig
 *
 * Description:
 *   Configure PLL1 from values supplied by board.h (M, N, IC1_DIV).  The
 *   clock tree is laid out in the board header; see board.h for the full
 *   diagram.
